OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 25 NOV
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GExclusive music-making including
OL,6,     GMozart's Prague Symphony from
OL,7,     GSwitzerland and highlights from
OL,8,     Gthis year's Bath Mozartfest.
OL,9,G1600FComposer of the Week: Max Roach
OL,10,     GKate Molleson is joined by Kevin
OL,11,     GLeGendre to explore the life and
OL,12,     Gwork of drummer and composer Max
OL,13,     GRoach. Today focusing on his
OL,14,     Gcollaboration with Clifford Brown.
OL,15,G1700FIn Tune
OL,16,     GLive music and interviews from
OL,17,     Gthe world's finest classical
OL,18,     Gmusicians.
OL,19,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,20,     GUplifting choral music opens and
OL,21,     Gcloses this evocative Classical
OL,22,     GMixtape from BBC Radio 3.
